Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.83,0:00:04.35,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,An underground passage?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.35,0:00:06.86,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Are you sure there even is one?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.86,0:00:09.27,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,It's got to be there somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.86,0:00:12.61,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Well then, what do you need me to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.78,0:00:15.36,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Move the rubble.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.36,0:00:16.38,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.38,0:00:20.12,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Use a gnome to find the passage\Nburied beneath all the debris.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.53,0:00:23.62,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,W-Wait just a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.94,0:00:27.94,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,I can alter stone, as I did in Sungard,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.94,0:00:31.76,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,but summoning a gnome for long periods \Nuses tremendous magic power.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.76,0:00:38.82,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,And you expect me to use it to find a path \Nthat may or may not exist under all {\i1}that{\i0}?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.77,0:00:42.33,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.53,0:00:47.98,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,You haven't the faintest idea\N where this passage is, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.98,0:00:50.27,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,I'll burn through my magic in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.27,0:00:52.99,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Magic power can be replenished!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.62,0:00:56.01,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Go on! Use as many as you need!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.82,0:01:04.03,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Kyle, do you have any idea\N what using one of those is like?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.49,0:01:06.92,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Yeah. They're extremely effective.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.36,0:01:10.42,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,And they taste terrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.17,0:01:15.42,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I'm begging you. There's no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.42,0:01:19.94,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,While we're standing around arguing,\N Gazus could be in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.65,0:01:21.83,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Urza...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.83,0:01:24.65,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Please, Urza! You're the \Nonly one who can do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.65,0:01:27.84,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,You can do it! You can do \Nanything you put your mind to!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.84,0:01:29.31,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Please, Urza!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.06,0:01:31.07,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Oh, fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.30,0:01:33.61,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,If that's what you want, I'll do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.26,0:01:37.61,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Now we just pin our hopes on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.61,0:01:40.95,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,If you find that holy sword, \Nbe sure to grab it for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.69,0:01:45.45,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Theron, you're certain the \Ndemon you saw was a guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.81,0:01:49.21,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,I only caught a glimpse through \Nthe window, but yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.54,0:01:51.87,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,You saw a woman, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.87,0:01:52.96,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.96,0:01:58.35,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Which means there are at least \Ntwo demons in Karan right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.07,0:02:02.83,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Two demons...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.67,0:03:50.25,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Yuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.74,0:03:56.29,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,I feel sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.86,0:03:59.51,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.47,0:04:07.39,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.39,0:04:08.98,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Hey, Kyle!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.62,0:04:10.99,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Did you find something?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.19,0:04:18.52,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,This has got to be it—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.95,0:04:21.10,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,The hidden underground passage!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.53,0:04:29.89,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Stay on your guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.29,0:04:32.89,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Those demons might be up ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.54,0:04:35.01,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Demons, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.01,0:04:38.79,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,That was my first time seeing one, \Nbut he seemed real dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.09,0:04:42.09,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Like my mom when she fights all out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.18,0:04:47.30,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Individual demons are superior \Nin combat compared to humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.61,0:04:51.06,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,You're not wrong to regard them\N as monsters like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.06,0:04:54.34,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,I'm going to tell Miss Layla\N what you said about her!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.73,0:04:57.31,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,You're quite knowledgeable about demons, Kyle.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.77,0:05:00.57,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,They warrant that much caution.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.89,0:05:02.96,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,They're dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.96,0:05:07.19,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,With the shape Urza's in, the two \Nof you shouldn't go any farther.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.19,0:05:10.53,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,What?! Surely you're not \Ntelling us to turn back now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.53,0:05:11.85,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,We've come this far!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.85,0:05:13.98,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,We're staying with you until the end!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.74,0:05:17.71,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,It'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.70,0:05:20.67,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,Theron's here this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.91,0:05:25.51,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,Worst case, even if {\i0}he{\i1} shows up, \NI should be able to protect them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.98,0:05:28.66,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Kyle, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.19,0:05:45.44,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,No way. Is this...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.95,0:05:50.94,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,It's too similar.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.05,0:05:54.33,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,What's all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.33,0:05:56.71,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,A forbidden rite.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.95,0:06:04.21,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,Though, from the look of it,\Nthe scale and formula are simple enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.21,0:06:06.72,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,What's this about it being forbidden?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.72,0:06:10.89,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,It's a ritual to convert the life energy \Nof a sacrifice into magic power.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.97,0:06:13.22,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,These clothes...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.65,0:06:16.98,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,This is the governor's aide\N we met the other day!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.98,0:06:21.05,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Then those must be the \Nkidnapped people of Karan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.41,0:06:27.61,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,In other words, someone needed \Nsacrifices for some powerful magic,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.61,0:06:31.21,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,so they resorted to kidnapping residents?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.58,0:06:33.62,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,That's what it looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.95,0:06:35.37,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,I see, I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.60,0:06:37.93,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,They're focusing on quality over quantity.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.93,0:06:42.91,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,This magic circle slowly squeezes \Nthe life out of each victim.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.35,0:06:46.88,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,But with this meager catalyst...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.32,0:06:51.09,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,It will soon exceed its capacity\N for magic power and blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.09,0:06:54.14,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Are you saying it'll explode?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.14,0:07:00.27,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,Indeed. And with that much magic,\Nit could wipe half the city off the map.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.27,0:07:02.15,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,That would be a catastrophe!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.15,0:07:06.15,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,So, what kind of spell \Nare they trying to cast here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.62,0:07:08.59,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,I can't be certain, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.67,0:07:12.25,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,I sense someone approaching.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.89,0:07:33.30,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,Looks like it's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.53,0:07:38.18,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,Would it hurt you to say anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.35,0:07:42.65,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,Does our current situation displease you so?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.02,0:07:47.19,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,Working with a human collaborator \Nto gather intel peacefully...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.19,0:07:49.83,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,I thought you were on board with the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.83,0:07:51.70,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,How is this peaceful?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.70,0:07:55.37,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,This was the human's idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.37,0:07:57.70,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,They can be so barbaric.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.70,0:08:01.08,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,I'm talking about you killing \Nthe humanoids at the embassy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.31,0:08:03.54,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,Was that really necessary?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.83,0:08:07.61,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,That was also our collaborator's request.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.61,0:08:09.71,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,How could I refuse?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.18,0:08:14.50,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,I feel I've followed our order\Nabout minimizing casualties, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.07,0:08:18.86,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,We were also ordered \Nnot to attract attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.60,0:08:20.97,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,That demon...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.97,0:08:23.60,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,Again, it was our collaborator's request.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.60,0:08:27.17,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,He said to make a scene, since he\Nwas staging an abduction elsewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.17,0:08:27.98,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,Even so!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.37,0:08:31.86,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,More importantly, have you forgotten?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.18,0:08:37.37,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,About the item our king desires.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.45,0:08:43.12,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,It still irritates me to be\N working with a mere human.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.37,0:08:50.38,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,We must cooperate with him to get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.38,0:08:55.40,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,This, too, shows our loyalty to our liege!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.47,0:09:07.14,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,All we do is for the demon king.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.07,0:09:09.15,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,The demon king?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.38,0:09:12.15,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,Now then, I've finished cleaning up the trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.15,0:09:15.15,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,This is one depressing hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.38,0:09:18.41,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,I'm going to get some fresh air.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.17,0:09:30.49,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,We managed not to get caught.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.49,0:09:32.81,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,That was incredibly tense.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.29,0:09:36.06,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,They sounded so stuck-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.06,0:09:39.22,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Even if they weren't demons, \Nwe'd never be friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.97,0:09:43.61,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,Minimizing casualties, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.61,0:09:48.69,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,I've heard the current demon king \Nis quite moderate, but how strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.01,0:09:51.87,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Well, thanks to this,\Nwe've gotten some good intel.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.87,0:09:52.69,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Now...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.63,0:09:56.66,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,We just have to find Governor Bax and Gazus.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.59,0:10:04.69,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,What is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.14,0:10:12.13,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Kyle!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.49,0:10:16.18,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Is that... Gazus?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.95,0:10:19.09,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Thank goodness! He's alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.09,0:10:21.60,Default,BAX,0,0,0,,Who are you people?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.30,0:10:27.19,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Are you... Governor Bax?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.42,0:10:30.06,Default,BAX,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.39,0:10:32.59,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.59,0:10:34.82,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,You refused to see us because you were ill.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.32,0:10:39.18,Default,BAX,0,0,0,,I see. It's you lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.81,0:10:43.08,Default,BAX,0,0,0,,You're the messengers from Zirgus.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.39,0:10:47.86,Default,BAX,0,0,0,,The empire invaded us\Nand Zirgus tried to control us,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.30,0:10:50.58,Default,BAX,0,0,0,,but you won't get your way with our city!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.58,0:10:53.34,Default,BAX,0,0,0,,I will protect Karan!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.69,0:10:56.21,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Protect it? What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.73,0:11:00.34,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,You're kidnapping residents \Nand sacrificing them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.34,0:11:02.17,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Why would you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.47,0:11:05.25,Default,BAX,0,0,0,,For Karan...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.25,0:11:07.47,Default,BAX,0,0,0,,To protect Karan!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.94,0:11:09.38,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Protect Karan?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.81,0:11:11.90,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Is something going to happen to it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.33,0:11:17.74,Default,GAZUS,0,0,0,,Karan's ore veins will soon be depleted.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.45,0:11:20.24,Default,BAX,0,0,0,,Gazus, don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.24,0:11:22.07,Default,BAX,0,0,0,,You would still defy me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.07,0:11:27.08,Default,GAZUS,0,0,0,,Sir, there's no hiding it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.08,0:11:30.78,Default,GAZUS,0,0,0,,It's time to reveal the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.02,0:11:33.66,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,The ore veins?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.66,0:11:36.09,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Karan's lifeblood.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.13,0:11:39.97,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,I suppose they wouldn't last\N a whole millennium.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.39,0:11:45.87,Default,GAZUS,0,0,0,,Once the veins are depleted, \NKaran will have nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.87,0:11:50.38,Default,GAZUS,0,0,0,,Jobs will dry up. Our skilled smiths\Nwill scatter to the winds.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.90,0:11:56.23,Default,GAZUS,0,0,0,,Zirgus's control will grow stronger, \Nand we'll lose our autonomy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.23,0:11:59.86,Default,GAZUS,0,0,0,,The empire might even invade again!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.86,0:12:03.36,Default,BAX,0,0,0,,Shut up! I won't let that happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.36,0:12:05.85,Default,BAX,0,0,0,,We must reclaim our former glory!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.85,0:12:08.37,Default,BAX,0,0,0,,I'll do whatever it takes!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.62,0:12:11.18,Default,GAZUS,0,0,0,,At this rate, Karan is done for!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.53,0:12:14.03,Default,GAZUS,0,0,0,,You were afraid of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.79,0:12:19.38,Default,GAZUS,0,0,0,,You wanted to reclaim our glory.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.74,0:12:23.83,Default,GAZUS,0,0,0,,You said it would require some sacrifices.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.83,0:12:26.50,Default,BAX,0,0,0,,The sacrifices are a trivial problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.50,0:12:28.82,Default,BAX,0,0,0,,No, they're not even a problem at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.86,0:12:34.64,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,You're terminally ill, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.06,0:12:38.40,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,I'd wager you only have a month left.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.93,0:12:40.89,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,So he really is sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.33,0:12:44.40,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,The demons took advantage\N of his vulnerability.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.40,0:12:47.16,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,How very rude of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.11,0:12:55.57,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,I'd rather you not accuse us\Nof taking advantage of anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.45,0:12:59.67,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,We simply offered him a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.30,0:13:18.31,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,Miranda! You're awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.85,0:13:22.32,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,G-Goh...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.82,0:13:25.99,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,I-I...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.29,0:13:27.76,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.76,0:13:30.95,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,I'm sure Kyle's party will find Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.58,0:13:36.90,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,A deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.39,0:13:38.46,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.38,0:13:43.85,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,I have no reason to tell you, but so be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.46,0:13:50.01,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,This place was originally created\Nwhen the ore veins were consolidated.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.01,0:13:53.97,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,And more could be gathered\N with the same magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.47,0:13:58.75,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I see. So that's what the \Nforbidden rite is for.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.75,0:14:00.30,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,Correct!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.30,0:14:02.98,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,Hence why we made a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.30,0:14:06.14,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,In that case, you must've \Nasked something in return.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.62,0:14:07.99,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,What are you after?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.42,0:14:11.74,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,Why, the sword, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.62,0:14:17.06,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,It was used to defeat the previous demon king.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.06,0:14:21.63,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,I've heard it's known among you\Nhumanoids as the Holy Sword Rand.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.19,0:14:25.63,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,Our sovereign wants it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.54,0:14:29.10,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,The Holy Sword Rand is here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.10,0:14:31.01,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,You even know about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.03,0:14:39.27,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,Originally, my mission was \Nto gather information on humanoids.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.37,0:14:43.65,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,What are you investigating \Nbesides the holy sword?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.53,0:14:50.47,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,Humanity's forces. Beginning with Karan,\N which produces untold weapons
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.47,0:14:52.91,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,used to make demons suffer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.91,0:14:58.90,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,In my reconnaissance, I learned of \NKaran's situation and the governor's worries,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.90,0:15:01.23,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,so I came along with a proposition.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.23,0:15:03.92,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,It was two birds with one stone!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.42,0:15:11.81,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Th-That's what you were up to all along?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.81,0:15:13.80,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,You dastardly fiend!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.34,0:15:16.81,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,Don't you think you've said too much?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.34,0:15:21.73,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Won't spill any more, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.73,0:15:22.94,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,No matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.94,0:15:25.59,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I'll take you on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.19,0:15:29.81,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,Oh? You've suddenly grown emboldened.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.81,0:15:31.95,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,Or perhaps desperate.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.95,0:15:34.67,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I was just letting you carry on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.01,0:15:41.21,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Both humanoids and demons get loose lips \Nwhen they think they have the upper hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.99,0:15:46.49,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,Th-That was merely a farewell gift!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.49,0:15:49.46,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,Don't get ahead of yourself, human!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.85,0:15:51.15,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.15,0:15:53.49,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,We must avoid as much fighting as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.49,0:15:58.31,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,Now that they've learned of our \Nexistence, they must be silenced.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.31,0:16:00.48,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,Our mission ends here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.48,0:16:03.23,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,Let's finish them off quickly and be gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.23,0:16:05.11,Default,BAX,0,0,0,,Wh-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.11,0:16:07.11,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,What about the sword?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.11,0:16:08.73,Default,BAX,0,0,0,,Th-That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.34,0:16:13.99,Default,BAX,0,0,0,,What about the holy sword?\NDon't you want it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.45,0:16:20.04,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.04,0:16:21.66,Default,BAX,0,0,0,,You can't leave now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.66,0:16:23.62,Default,BAX,0,0,0,,What will happen to Karan?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.02,0:16:25.89,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,You're still going on about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.89,0:16:29.71,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Do you really think demons would honor\Nany deal they made with humans?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.71,0:16:33.37,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,How dare you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.37,0:16:38.47,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,If not for this trouble, we would've used \Nthe earth-shifting magic as promised.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.47,0:16:40.65,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,That catalyst is already at its limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.65,0:16:41.87,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,They can't control it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.87,0:16:43.73,Default,BAX,0,0,0,,Wh-What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.73,0:16:46.53,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,You're quite knowledgeable.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.53,0:16:50.34,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,Well, even if the magic goes wild\N and wipes out the city,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.34,0:16:52.49,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,that's hardly our problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.75,0:16:55.99,Default,BAX,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.11,0:16:59.24,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Why don't you take a nap?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.24,0:17:01.84,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,You take the two girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.84,0:17:05.34,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,But we're to refrain from killing humans!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.34,0:17:07.88,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,It would seem they want a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.10,0:17:09.22,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Look after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.22,0:17:10.82,Default,GAZUS,0,0,0,,Yeah, you got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.14,0:17:22.64,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,This shower of sparks must be dealt with!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.33,0:17:26.64,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Theron, stick with those two.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.89,0:17:30.42,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Sorry. I'm curious about something.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.42,0:17:32.65,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,I'll be doing my own thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.65,0:17:34.78,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Huh? What're you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.78,0:17:38.66,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Fine. I'll figure it out, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.93,0:17:40.86,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I'll finish this guy quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.01,0:17:44.16,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.16,0:17:48.42,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,If you're so insistent, I'll play with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.65,0:17:59.81,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,Flee this place at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.81,0:18:01.43,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,I won't pursue you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.71,0:18:04.68,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,You think we'd fall for such an obvious trap?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.99,0:18:05.87,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,A trap?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.29,0:18:08.50,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,Why would I need to lay a trap?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.87,0:18:12.46,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,You cannot so much as lay a finger on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.46,0:18:14.70,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,I'm allowing you to escape. Now go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.33,0:18:18.57,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,You can't expect us to take that lying down!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.15,0:18:20.45,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Here I come!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.20,0:18:24.20,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,Fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.46,0:18:29.71,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Liese!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.98,0:18:32.09,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,You can't afford to take your eyes off me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.02,0:18:35.55,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Salamander!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.86,0:18:47.70,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Demons are certainly impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.70,0:18:50.60,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Her physical abilities are on another level.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.46,0:18:55.11,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,She can see everything they're about to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.51,0:18:57.78,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,I can tell how this will end.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.78,0:18:59.71,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,You're not going to help?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.15,0:19:04.37,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Nah. She doesn't intend to kill them, \Nand she's not even going all out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.78,0:19:07.14,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,This is a perfect first fight against demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.05,0:19:10.52,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,Indeed, it seems that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.52,0:19:14.02,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,More importantly, Sildonia, \Ndo you know what this is?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.55,0:19:15.75,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.18,0:19:19.51,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,I borrowed it from the governor.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.78,0:19:22.82,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,You've got some sticky fingers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.27,0:19:24.01,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.42,0:19:27.73,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,This is a special magic item.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.73,0:19:32.02,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,It conceals both a linked item\N and its magic power.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.30,0:19:33.96,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,I thought so.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.96,0:19:38.65,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,In other words, there's something nearby \Nthat he doesn't want us finding.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.27,0:19:41.61,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,When the holy sword came up earlier,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.61,0:19:46.37,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,the governor glanced in a certain direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.79,0:19:49.73,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,You have sticky fingers {\i1}and{\i0} keen eyes, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.55,0:19:55.78,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,But your theory may be on the mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.71,0:20:10.77,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.50,0:20:23.15,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,What happened to all your bravado?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.82,0:20:26.13,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,He's got as much magic power as they say.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.99,0:20:29.79,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,And his ability to cast \Nwithout incantations is a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.05,0:20:36.00,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,Just how many can he fire in a row?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.31,0:20:38.09,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,I can't even get close to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.90,0:20:42.26,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.98,0:21:01.71,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,A marvelous scream.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.71,0:21:04.61,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,It's time to end this!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.87,0:21:13.00,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,I'll leave your head \Nso you may have a proper burial.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.02,0:21:46.54,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,No doubt about it. This is it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.33,0:22:02.25,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,I found the holy sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.93,0:23:40.25,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnArial Black\fs12\shad0\blur1\bord1\3c&HB6A872&\pos(320,142.615)}Next Time
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.93,0:23:40.25,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnArial Black\fs18\shad0\blur1\3c&HB6A872&\pos(320,208.461)}Duel
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.86,0:23:38.74,Default,NA,0,0,0,,Next time: "Duel."
